    locator: https://cleanlanguage.com/less-is-more-the-art-of-clean-language/
    anchor: Syntax, The Basic Questions, Voice Qualities, 'Unclean' Language
    revision: Rapport 35, February 1997; wersja v2 zmodyfikowana 30.12.2003
